        "original_id": "20bf8979-a827-5706-a56d-97a78b978533",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Somerville, Limbo, Inside\n- Companies: Jumpship, Playdead\n- Topics: indie game development, puzzle-platform games, 2.5D gameplay\n\nFacts:\n- Limbo is a puzzle-platform video game developed by the independent studio Playdead.\n- Limbo was released in July 2010 on Xbox Live Arcade and was later ported to systems including PlayStation 3 and Microsoft Windows.\n- Inside is the spiritual successor to Playdead's 2010 game Limbo and features similar 2.5D gameplay.\n- Somerville is an upcoming video game and the debut title by the indie studio Jumpship.",
